Source: obsidian-kernel
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Obsidian OS <obsidian@localhost>
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)

Package: obsidian-kernel
Architecture: amd64
Provides: linux-image-amd64, linux-image
Conflicts: linux-image-amd64
Description: Obsidian OS hardened kernel (built by scripts/build-kernel.sh)
 The binary image is produced by the CI build-kernel job from the Debian
 linux source + debos/overlays-src/common/etc/obsidian/kernel/hardened.config;
 this control file exists so the .deb can be indexed into the obsidian repo and
 satisfy recipes that depend on linux-image-amd64.